{#
  Full-bleed landscape band: the photographic beat that sits between a service
  hero and the first light section below it. Every service page gets one, so the
  rhythm (deep blue hero, centred copy, then a wide photograph) is the same
  wherever you land.

  Driven from page front matter. `bandImage` and `bandAlt` are what it needs to
  render at all; `bandLabel`, `bandTitle` and `bandYear` are the optional caption
  row, reading left, centre and right. `bandFocus` takes an `object-position`
  value for photographs whose subject sits off-centre, since the band is a far
  wider crop than any of the pictures it holds.

  Not a link: projects live in the case-study section further down, not on a
  page of their own.
#}
{% if bandImage %}
    <figure class="band">
      <div class="band__media parallax">
        <img src="{{ bandImage }}" alt="{{ bandAlt }}"{% if bandFocus %} style="object-position: {{ bandFocus }}"{% endif %} loading="lazy">
      </div>
      {% if bandLabel or bandTitle or bandYear %}
      <figcaption class="container band__bar">
        <span class="band__label">{{ bandLabel }}</span>
        <span class="band__title">{{ bandTitle }}</span>
        <span class="band__year">{{ bandYear }}</span>
      </figcaption>
      {% endif %}
    </figure>
{% endif %}
